# Customer Churn Prediction & Automated Retraining System

Predict customer churn using machine learning, monitor data drift, and support continuous model improvement through automated retraining workflows.
---

## Project Overview

This project builds an end-to-end customer churn prediction pipeline that:

- Processes customer behavior and service usage data
- Predicts churn risk using machine learning models
- Tracks experiments and model performance
- Performs explainability analysis
- Supports automated retraining when model drift occurs
- Prepares deployment-ready model artifacts for cloud integration
---

