Workflow
1. Data Preprocessing
Load raw customer data
Handle missing values
Encode categorical variables
Scale numerical features
Save processed dataset

Output:

processed_data.csv

2. Exploratory Data Analysis

Analyze:

Churn distribution
Customer tenure
Monthly charges
Contract types
Feature relationships

Includes:

correlation analysis
business insights
imbalance detection

3. Model Development

Train and compare models:

Random Forest
XGBoost

Evaluate using:

Accuracy
Precision
Recall
F1 Score
ROC-AUC
Confusion Matrix

4. Hyperparameter Optimization

Improve best-performing model using:

Grid Search
Cross Validation
Threshold tuning

Artifacts saved:

churn_model.pkl
scaler.pkl
feature_columns.pkl

5. Model Explainability

Explain predictions using SHAP:

Feature importance
Global explainability
Local customer-level explainability
